flowchart TB
  subgraph P["Principal (PRIOR_ART.md §4 (ii), selected 2026-09-30)"]
    D["ONE constitution document<br/>/1: constitution_text + hard_rules<br/>/2: Markdown source with one twokey-rules block"]
    S["Principal's signature<br/>(Ed25519 / ECDSA P-384 / hybrid ML-DSA-65)"]
